{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/312","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/312/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/312/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/312/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/312","id":5096197360,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABL8HM8A","number":312,"title":"Triage the 71 records asserting a mapping their own research report advised against","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-08-08T06:17:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T06:10:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Finding\n\n`scripts/validate_records_against_research.py` (#309) compares each ingredient\nrecord against the deep-research report for that same ingredient. Over the 527\nrecords researched so far it found **71 `STATUS_CONFLICT`s** — the record asserts\nan ontology mapping while its own report recommended `UNMAPPED`.\n\n**Every one of them was written by the same mechanical sweep,\n`promote_resolved_unmapped`.** That is the #203/#263 pattern recurring: a\nplausible identifier promoted by a mechanism that never decided anything.\n\n## Important caveat — do not treat all 71 as defects\n\nThe Edison/PaperQA3 lane cannot open an ontology page. Its reports say so\nverbatim (\"no ChEBI CURIE was verified in the retrieved evidence\"), so it\ndefaults to \"retain UNMAPPED\" whenever it cannot confirm a term — which is most\nof the time. An Edison \"retain UNMAPPED\" on its own is therefore weak evidence.\n\nThat is exactly why the second (Claude) lane exists, and it already resolved 22\nof these: `LANE_DISAGREEMENT_RESOLVED` marks a conflict the Claude lane cleared\nby resolving the term Edison could not. Those 22 need no action.\n\n## Triage order\n\nWork `mappings/record_research_validation.md`, most severe first:\n\n1. **17 `BOTH_LANES_DISPUTE`** — both independent lanes dispute the mapping.\n   Strongest signal in the ledger; start here.\n2. **`P1 CURIE_REFUTED`** — a report names the record's exact CURIE and argues\n   against it. The quoted line usually names the right term.\n3. **`P1 VERDICT_REFUTES`** — a per-field verdict table refutes an identity\n   field and supplies a corrected value.\n4. The remainder of the `STATUS_CONFLICT`s, checking `promoted_by` and\n   `documented_rationale`.\n\nEach row carries the quoted report line that produced it, so most are a one-read\ndecision: keep with a written justification, downgrade `mapping_quality`, or\ndemote.\n\n## Note on coverage\n\nThe ledger currently covers 527 of 2,841 records; the Edison sweep is ongoing\n(~30 records/hour, account-capped). Re-run the validator as it completes — these\ncounts will grow.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/312/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}